font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Number of volunteers</text><line xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x1="79.37577629089355" y1="72" x2="79.37577629089355" y2="272" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="0.9"></line><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="111.11180114746094" y="132" height="140" width="31.736024856567383" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"></rect><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(126.97981357574463 291.84)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">A</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="174.5838508605957" y="192" height="80" width="31.736024856567383" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"></rect><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(190.4518632888794 291.84)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">B</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="238.05590057373047" y="92" height="180" width="31.736024856567383" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"></rect><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(253.92391300201416 291.84)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">C</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="301.52795028686523" y="242" height="30" width="31.736024856567383" fill="#B3B3B3" stroke="#000000" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"></rect><text xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0" y="0" text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(317.3959627151489 291.84)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">D</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(222.18788814544678 24)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> </text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(222.18788814544678 48)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> </text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(222.18788814544678 325.67999999999995)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Gift</text></g></svg><div role="region" aria-label="Long description for bar graph" class="sr-only"><ul>
<li>The Number of volunteers data for the 4 bars are as follows:<br>
<ul>
<li>A: 14</li>
<li>B: 8</li>
<li>C: 18</li>
<li>D: 3</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In April, there were <math alttext="43"><mn>43</mn>
</math> volunteers in a cleanup project. Each volunteer was asked to choose a small gift labeled A, B, C, or D. The bar graph shows the number of volunteers who chose each gift. How many volunteers chose gift C?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"aba7500f-313a-4900-9f09-e36b98116da1","content":"<p><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"5f670364-752b-4b99-904c-a78a947bd3f7","content":"<p><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"311ad159-bc46-4bbc-aae3-cd18a32e2bf1","content":"<p><math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"9fd6b7c1-cf35-469b-aee8-9076b3815e78","content":"<p><math alttext=\"18\"><mn>18</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["9fd6b7c1-cf35-469b-aee8-9076b3815e78"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is correct. The height of each bar in the graph shown represents the number of volunteers who chose the gift labeled with the letter specified at the bottom of the bar. The bar for gift C has a height of <math alttext="18"><mn>18</mn>
</math>. Therefore, <math alttext="18"><mn>18</mn>
</math> volunteers chose gift C.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the number of volunteers who chose gift D, not gift C.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This is the number of volunteers who chose gift B, not gift C.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the number of volunteers who chose gift A, not gift C.</p>
