"><mi>z</mi>\n</math> that is <math alttext=\"1.113\"><mn>1.113</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"1.13\"><mn>1.13</mn>\n</math>, times <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This gives a value of <math alttext=\"z\"><mi>z</mi>\n</math> that is <math alttext=\"2.30\"><mn>2.30</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"1.13\"><mn>1.13</mn>\n</math>, times <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This gives a value of <math alttext=\"z\"><mi>z</mi>\n</math> that is <math alttext=\"3.13\"><mn>3.13</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"1.13\"><mn>1.13</mn>\n</math>, times <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>.</p>","origin":"manifold","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The value of <math alttext=\"z\"><mi>z</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"1.13\"><mn>1.13</mn>\n</math> times <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>. The value of <math alttext=\"z\"><mi>z</mi>\n</math> is what percent greater than <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>?</p>","externalid":"f518f607-0819-47bd-b33b-db922ee03cb2","templateid":"f3d8d5de-acc1-4227-89fe-75ed2839986d","vaultid":"404d0e86-6fe2-4b4c-a04d-cd6b20f3391a","type":"mcq","answerOptions":[{"id":"f492c516-5606-4089-a743-8ca7165a254c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"11.3\"><mn>11.3</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"616d2dc0-7584-48d4-a30a-28f6d489cbd0","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"13\"><mn>13</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"fa2127e4-8c0c-460f-8d75-925e52a5db75","content":"<p><math alttext=\"130\"><mn>130</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"01c8004c-e721-455e-a3a4-740b12b5bd70","content":"<p><math alttext=\"213\"><mn>213</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"correct_answer":["B"]},"createDate":1691007959832,"updateDate":1691007959832}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959832, 1691007959832),
    ($SATQ$7270d642$SATQ$, $SATQ$70312974-5b98-4396-b51e-4f590919f407$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Ratios, rates, proportional relationships, and units$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">A certain bird species can fly at an average speed of <math alttext="16"><mn>16</mn>
</math> meters per second when in continuous flight. At this rate, how many meters would this bird species fly in <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> seconds?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"5543f0f5-0b8c-46a5-8751-bf3f1f1d0df0","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"1f93d690-3052-4971-b9a8-088de7858f24","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"20\"><mn>20</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"9f1f0f9a-e465-4d1b-86fb-6ca9019e8f4c","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"04270eb9-18ad-42f8-bd8c-2370a1c76d40","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["5543f0f5-0b8c-46a5-8751-bf3f1f1d0df0"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is correct. It's given that a certain bird species can fly at an average speed of <math alttext="16"><mn>16</mn>
</math> meters per second when in continuous flight. At this rate, in <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> seconds this bird species would fly <math alttext="left parenthesis StartFraction 16 meters Over second EndFraction right parenthesis left parenthesis 4 seconds right parenthesis"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>meters</mtext></mrow><mtext>second</mtext></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>seconds</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext="64"><mn>64</mn>
</math> meters.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This is the value of <math alttext="16 plus 4"><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, not <math alttext="16 left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis"><mn>16</mn><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the distance the bird would fly in <math alttext="1"><mn>1</mn>
</math> second, not <math alttext="4"><mn>4</mn>
</math> seconds.</p>
