</math> to <math alttext="t"><mi>t</mi>
</math>. This can be represented by <math alttext="StartFraction x Over y EndFraction equals StartFraction 12 Over t EndFraction"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></math>. Substituting <math alttext="156"><mn>156</mn>
</math> for <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
